      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Identity decides the operation\n\n**Same nodeId** targets a graph whose Declaration also identifies `portal-identity-subject`. It must expand into this semantic node without adding a workspace frame.\n\n**Different nodeId** targets `portal-identity-other`. It must open alongside as another graph frame.\n\nThe fixture states the current explicit modes so it remains runnable while automatic `nodeId` dispatch is implemented. Declaration `nodeId` remains the semantic dispatch key."
